#: templates/legacy/import_start.html:6
msgid ""
"Imports everything from the previous webshop that PackDesk knows: the "
"catalogue, customers with addresses, contacts and logins (with their own "
"passwords), orders, licences with options and extensions, invoices with "
"payments, spare parts requests and orders, printing services (as an "
"archive), telephony, and the number counters."
msgstr ""
"Importeert alles uit de vorige webshop wat PackDesk kent: de catalogus, "
"klanten met adressen, contactpersonen en logins (met hun eigen wachtwoord), "
"bestellingen, licenties met opties en verlengingen, facturen met betalingen, "
"onderdelenaanvragen en -bestellingen, printing services (als archief), "
"telefonie en de nummertellers."

#: templates/legacy/import_start.html:7
msgid ""
"Uses the table mappings of this database. Running it again updates what was "
"imported before and never creates anything twice; nothing in PackDesk is "
"deleted. Every row of the old database ends up in the report, with what "
"happened to it."
msgstr ""
"Gebruikt de koppelingen van deze database. Opnieuw draaien werkt bij wat "
"eerder is geïmporteerd en maakt nooit iets dubbel aan; er wordt niets in "
"PackDesk verwijderd. Elke rij van de oude database komt in het verslag, met "
"wat ermee is gebeurd."

#: templates/legacy/import_start.html:8
msgid ""
"This database has no table mappings yet. Load the mapping for the previous "
"webshop first."
msgstr ""
"Deze database heeft nog geen koppelingen. Laad eerst de koppeling voor de "
"vorige webshop."

#: templates/legacy/import_start.html:14
msgid ""
"Does everything and writes the report, then undoes it. Nothing changes in "
"PackDesk."
msgstr ""
"Doet alles en schrijft het verslag, en draait het daarna terug. Er verandert "
"niets in PackDesk."

