#: templates/setup/database.html:11
msgid ""
"Fill in the database server PackDesk uses. PackDesk always gets its own "
"database; other databases on the same server are not touched."
msgstr ""
"Vul de databaseserver in die PackDesk gebruikt. PackDesk krijgt altijd een "
