msgid "Database connected"
msgstr "Database gekoppeld"

#: templates/setup/restarting.html:7
msgid ""
"PackDesk restarts to use the database and then continues with the "
"installation. This takes a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"PackDesk start opnieuw om de database te gebruiken en gaat daarna verder met "
"de installatie. Dit duurt een paar seconden."

#: templates/setup/restarting.html:8
msgid "Waiting…"
msgstr "Even geduld…"

